#!/bin/sh
# The stand-in `gh`, which is gh.ts beside this file. A run copies both onto
# its PATH and names the repository's tsx in AMY_E2E_TSX; run in place, the
# repository's own is found from here.
here=$(dirname "$0")
exec "${AMY_E2E_TSX:-$here/../../../../node_modules/.bin/tsx}" "$here/gh.ts" "$@"
